  "description": "Western College – Premium Western Font\nCombine rugged frontier strength with classic campus style using Western College! This bold display font features sharp western spurs, thick slab-serif structures, and clean outlines. Designed for maximum visual impact, it is perfect for western apparel, college sports logos, rodeo posters, country music merchandise, t-shirt prints, labels, and vintage crafts.\nIdeal for crafting SVG cut files with Cricut or Silhouette, print-on-demand items, and rustic branding designs. Give your creative projects a strong, authentic western collegiate flair!",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Western College – Premium Western Font</p>\n<p>Combine rugged frontier strength with classic campus style using Western College! This bold display font features sharp western spurs, thick slab-serif structures, and clean outlines. Designed for maximum visual impact, it is perfect for western apparel, college sports logos, rodeo posters, country music merchandise, t-shirt prints, labels, and vintage crafts.</p>\n<p>Ideal for crafting SVG cut files with Cricut or Silhouette, print-on-demand items, and rustic branding designs. Give your creative projects a strong, authentic western collegiate flair!</p>",
